<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Smelting 1996 net falls 4.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Smelting 1996 net falls 4.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  11.89   vs	  12.44</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 16.0    vs	  17.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   394.29   vs	 422.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    17.07   vs	  17.55</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    less  3.0    vs	   nil</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	 13.0    vs	  13.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is Malaysia Smelting Corp Bhd. It is involved in smelting of tin concentrates and tin bearing materials.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
